    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this data",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "All stock numbers are **simulated**: the simulator sells and restocks eight dark stores. Available stock is on-hand stock; order reservations are out of scope. Demand on empty shelves is flagged with the stock when the minute was written: an estimate that a replay can change."
      }
